<title>USA: Chrysler November US vehicle sales rise.</title>
<headline>Chrysler November US vehicle sales rise.</headline>
<dateline>DETROIT 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chrysler Corp</p>
<p>			Nov 1-30, 1996     Nov 1-30, 1995 *Pct Chng</p>
<p> Domestic Car	    52,101	    57,408	     -9.2</p>
<p> Domestic Truck	 127,527	   118,821	     +7.3</p>
<p> Import Car		     0		 844	     N.A.</p>
<p> Import Truck		   0		   0	     N.A.</p>
<p>		  Jan 1-Nov 30, 1996 Jan 1-Nov 30, 1995 *Pct Chng</p>
<p> Domestic Car	   770,339	   716,684	     +6.7</p>
<p> Domestic Truck     1,495,991	 1,255,695	    +18.3</p>
<p> Import Car		 4,692	    14,161	    -67.1</p>
<p> Import Truck		   0		   0	     N.A.</p>
<p>* Pct change based on daily selling rate. Sale days 25 in latest month vs 25, 283 for year to date vs 281 in year ago.</p>
